WEBVTT

01:36.270 --> 01:41.009
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.520 --> 01:43.910
[Episode 6]

01:51.710 --> 01:52.840
Indeed impressive.

01:54.840 --> 01:55.770
Now it's my turn.

02:17.079 --> 02:18.590
Yiren, I won.

02:26.840 --> 02:27.840
Show me your hand.

02:29.930 --> 02:30.740
Show it.

02:52.400 --> 02:54.079
I thought you had finally
shown some ambition,

02:54.079 --> 02:55.610
so I agreed to this contest.

02:56.000 --> 02:58.600
But I never thought
you'd resort to such tricks

02:58.630 --> 03:00.090
instead of training hard.

03:00.400 --> 03:01.240
Well, Yiren,

03:03.280 --> 03:04.470
don't get upset.

03:05.680 --> 03:08.190
The martial world is going through
a period of turmoil now.

03:08.190 --> 03:09.310
In terms of martial arts,

03:09.310 --> 03:11.680
there's always someone mightier out there.

03:11.680 --> 03:12.310
Besides,

03:12.400 --> 03:15.150
isn't it good for the young leader
of the Xiao family

03:15.150 --> 03:16.230
to be smart?

03:17.190 --> 03:18.590
I'm winning with my wits,

03:18.910 --> 03:20.520
which is still within the rules.

03:20.520 --> 03:21.450
Father, Mother,

03:21.870 --> 03:23.630
Yiren can't deny he lost,

03:23.630 --> 03:24.190
right?

03:24.190 --> 03:25.630
Exactly. A loss is a loss.

03:30.710 --> 03:31.430
Nonsense.

03:32.030 --> 03:34.290
Such sophistry is not the righteous way.

03:34.360 --> 03:37.560
Then how are we doing
the second round of the lightness skill?

03:37.560 --> 03:40.240
Whoever grabs the flower first wins.

03:56.000 --> 03:56.960
Is Qiushui

03:58.470 --> 03:59.730
doing this on purpose?

04:00.800 --> 04:03.000
He's trying to provoke his big brother.

04:11.190 --> 04:12.450
One, two, three, four.

04:25.680 --> 04:27.080
What is this trick again?

04:29.950 --> 04:32.480
Qiushui, are these contests
you've arranged

04:32.950 --> 04:34.610
all about unorthodox tricks?

04:35.950 --> 04:37.480
Our Xiao family commands respect

04:37.480 --> 04:39.310
in the martial world by real skills.

04:39.310 --> 04:40.600
Such deceptive techniques you use

04:40.600 --> 04:41.800
are never righteous.

04:41.830 --> 04:44.230
Do you have any regard
for our family rules?

04:47.040 --> 04:48.440
If Qiushui keeps this up,

04:48.830 --> 04:50.830
I'm afraid Yiren will truly get mad.

04:50.920 --> 04:52.980
He'll definitely be punished again.

04:53.270 --> 04:54.040
Don't worry.

04:54.240 --> 04:56.790
Hasn't Qiushui caused enough trouble
since childhood?

04:56.790 --> 04:58.650
Didn't he always get away with it?

05:04.240 --> 05:05.500
A contest is a contest.

05:05.800 --> 05:07.630
We win or lose based on real skill.

05:07.630 --> 05:09.890
Don't think about playing tricks again.

05:10.360 --> 05:10.870
Fine.

05:25.920 --> 05:26.430
Nice!

05:30.120 --> 05:31.450
Have a nice, fair match!

05:32.190 --> 05:34.190
Mother's Three Styles of Boldness.

05:34.310 --> 05:37.310
Mother even taught
her special technique to Qiushui.

05:47.159 --> 05:48.159
Watch out, Yiren!

06:17.190 --> 06:19.190
Qiushui is using
the sword technique in reverse.

06:19.190 --> 06:20.450
Isn't that dangerous?

06:41.120 --> 06:42.510
Qiushui, are you okay?

06:42.510 --> 06:43.040
Qiushui.

06:43.159 --> 06:44.240
Did you hit your head?

06:44.240 --> 06:44.770
Qiushui.

06:45.190 --> 06:46.650
Are you alright, Qiushui?

06:49.720 --> 06:51.070
I-I'm fine, Mother.

06:51.720 --> 06:53.750
Mother, it was indeed my fault just now.

06:53.750 --> 06:55.350
I went too far in that strike.

06:55.750 --> 06:58.760
However, Qiushui usually
goes for unorthodox tricks.

06:58.760 --> 07:00.640
If he continues like this
when he sets foot

07:00.640 --> 07:01.840
in the martial world,

07:01.870 --> 07:03.360
he'll surely suffer for it.

07:03.360 --> 07:05.240
I only wanted to teach him a lesson

07:05.630 --> 07:07.090
and remind him to practice

07:07.430 --> 07:09.360
martial arts in the righteous way.

07:09.920 --> 07:11.920
Good thing that nobody got injured.

07:16.070 --> 07:16.800
But Father,

07:17.940 --> 07:19.800
I-I didn't get the flower either.

07:30.870 --> 07:33.680
The Token of the Huanhua Sect Leader

07:34.270 --> 07:35.240
is henceforth

07:35.920 --> 07:39.120
entrusted to Xiao Yiren temporarily.

07:50.360 --> 07:52.290
But the matter of Young Leadership

07:54.040 --> 07:56.360
will be postponed for the time being.

08:05.190 --> 08:05.800
Qiushui,

08:06.750 --> 08:09.310
you could've dodged that move just now.

08:09.750 --> 08:10.680
Why didn't you?

08:11.720 --> 08:12.510
Xilou,

08:13.000 --> 08:15.680
how could Qiushui possibly dodge
that blow of sword energy?

08:15.680 --> 08:17.540
Do you think I couldn't recognize

08:18.070 --> 08:19.800
your Three Styles of Boldness?

08:20.420 --> 08:22.300
He did dodge the first two moves,

08:22.330 --> 08:25.060
and he could've obviously
avoided the last one.

08:29.040 --> 08:31.240
But Qiushui, why didn't you dodge it?

08:34.150 --> 08:36.549
Father, Mother,
and everyone else were behind me.

08:36.549 --> 08:37.549
How could I dodge?

08:40.110 --> 08:42.620
It's wrong to use tricks in combat.

08:43.630 --> 08:46.750
You should have lost this match.

08:47.360 --> 08:50.560
But you sacrificed yourself
to protect those behind you,

08:50.600 --> 08:53.150
which has earned you a chance.

08:53.670 --> 08:54.390
Therefore,

08:55.550 --> 08:58.610
I appoint your elder brother
as the acting sect leader.

08:58.980 --> 08:59.980
Six months later,

09:00.270 --> 09:01.270
you two brothers

09:02.270 --> 09:05.390
will have a fair match one more time.

09:07.150 --> 09:09.320
No, no. Father, that's not okay.

09:09.440 --> 09:10.720
Six months is too long.

09:10.750 --> 09:11.480
I need to...

09:18.790 --> 09:20.610
Your goal is to be a sect leader.

09:21.240 --> 09:23.900
If you can't even wait patiently
for six months,

09:24.000 --> 09:25.930
then you'd better forget about it.

09:26.720 --> 09:27.840
In this world,

09:28.390 --> 09:30.320
all you need is a clear conscience.

09:30.870 --> 09:33.200
If something is not yours yet,

09:33.480 --> 09:35.000
there's no use rushing it.

09:35.510 --> 09:37.240
Whatever consequences arise,

09:38.080 --> 09:40.440
the Huanhua Sect will bear them.

09:47.720 --> 09:48.270
Qiushui.

09:50.360 --> 09:52.550
I'm sorry for what I did earlier.

09:53.030 --> 09:54.160
I was too impatient.

09:54.790 --> 09:56.590
Please don't hold it against me.

09:57.910 --> 09:58.960
I-I won't.

10:00.000 --> 10:01.000
After six months,

10:01.270 --> 10:02.930
let's have a fair match again.

10:05.510 --> 10:07.150
The supplies are almost ready.

10:07.150 --> 10:08.610
Don't waste time anymore.

10:08.670 --> 10:12.150
You guys should set out
for Guangling Villa immediately.

10:12.200 --> 10:12.480
Yes.

10:12.480 --> 10:13.200
Guangling?

10:17.120 --> 10:18.480
Yiren? Yiren?

10:24.080 --> 10:25.960
You've lost your personal sword.

10:29.260 --> 10:30.990
This iron sword is also broken.

10:35.910 --> 10:37.310
What else can you use?

10:41.390 --> 10:44.360
I remember we still have
some fine swords at home.

10:46.120 --> 10:47.200
Go pick one.

10:48.120 --> 10:48.630
Father.

10:50.120 --> 10:52.600
Can I borrow

10:52.750 --> 10:53.840
our family's Changge Sword?

10:53.840 --> 10:54.390
Qiushui.

10:55.030 --> 10:56.240
Are you serious?

10:57.120 --> 10:59.720
The Changge Sword
represents the Sect Leader.

11:00.000 --> 11:02.460
You want to become
the Sect Leader directly?

11:02.910 --> 11:04.310
N-No, I didn't mean that.

11:07.960 --> 11:09.750
Focus on solid martial arts training.

11:09.750 --> 11:11.680
Stop thinking about those tricks!

11:14.120 --> 11:15.050
Are you alright?

11:15.120 --> 11:16.320
Does it hurt again?

11:18.030 --> 11:19.490
You're harming him again.

11:23.390 --> 11:24.450
Get some good rest.

11:24.480 --> 11:26.080
I'll come check on you later.

11:29.600 --> 11:30.270
Man...

11:31.320 --> 11:32.850
I'll get you some medicine.

11:33.390 --> 11:34.390
Thank you, Xueyu.

11:39.080 --> 11:41.550
There's nothing we can do but wait.

11:48.430 --> 11:49.030
Endure it.

11:51.000 --> 11:54.360
Xiao Qiushui,
you never fail to surprise me.

11:55.200 --> 11:56.270
In the future,

11:56.840 --> 11:59.550
you will surely surpass
your father and elder brother.

11:59.550 --> 12:00.510
But what a pity.

12:01.120 --> 12:03.250
I won't give the Xiao family that time.

12:05.480 --> 12:08.510
Yiren's Huanhua Sword Technique is
truly formidable.

12:08.510 --> 12:10.840
Next time, I really can't take it head-on.

12:11.480 --> 12:12.030
Qiushui.

12:14.910 --> 12:16.480
Xueyu, have a seat.

12:17.360 --> 12:18.420
Does it still hurt?

12:18.750 --> 12:19.360
It's okay.

12:21.000 --> 12:23.130
I'll go to Guangling Villa with Yiren.

12:25.240 --> 12:26.200
Remember to apply

12:26.200 --> 12:28.260
these meds to your wounds regularly.

12:30.360 --> 12:31.910
Thank you, Xueyu.

12:32.270 --> 12:35.030
Actually, Yiren cares about you a lot.

12:35.670 --> 12:37.240
When he knew I was coming to see you,

12:37.240 --> 12:38.840
he acted like he didn't care,

12:39.390 --> 12:41.360
but specifically mentioned several herbs,

12:41.360 --> 12:43.090
wanting me to bring them to you.

12:45.670 --> 12:47.730
I know Yiren wants what's best for me.

12:50.200 --> 12:50.800
By the way,

12:50.890 --> 12:53.270
Mother asked me
to bring you some gifts from Zihui.

12:53.270 --> 12:54.730
I'll go fetch them for you.

12:54.790 --> 12:57.650
Qiushui,
the carriage is already waiting outside.

12:58.150 --> 12:59.390
You can give

12:59.720 --> 13:01.750
those gifts to me when I return.

13:04.960 --> 13:06.750
Qiushui, honestly,

13:07.480 --> 13:09.010
why did you suddenly decide

13:09.200 --> 13:11.720
to compete with Yiren
for the family leadership?

13:11.720 --> 13:12.670
Anyway,

13:13.000 --> 13:14.600
it's good that you have a goal.

13:14.600 --> 13:16.400
But you can't just talk about it.

13:17.030 --> 13:18.560
Don't slack off in practice

13:18.670 --> 13:19.480
when I'm away,

13:19.910 --> 13:21.440
unable to keep an eye on you.

13:22.870 --> 13:24.200
I know. Don't worry.

13:26.030 --> 13:26.670
Qiushui,

13:27.870 --> 13:30.000
among the younger generation
in today's martial world,

13:30.000 --> 13:32.000
Yiren is indeed outstanding.

13:32.550 --> 13:34.010
But you don't need to rush.

13:34.360 --> 13:36.000
After you gain more experience

13:36.000 --> 13:37.030
in the future,

13:37.320 --> 13:39.850
our Xiao family will have
another great hero.

13:42.080 --> 13:42.880
I understand.

13:43.910 --> 13:45.550
By the way, Xueyu,

13:46.480 --> 13:47.840
don't take to heart

13:48.320 --> 13:49.720
what Kang Jiesheng said.

13:50.840 --> 13:52.720
Whatever kind of partner
you want in the future,

13:52.720 --> 13:53.850
you have my support.

13:55.960 --> 13:58.360
Of course,
I want a heroic man of integrity,

13:58.550 --> 13:59.870
skilled in martial arts,

13:59.870 --> 14:01.270
decisive in his actions,

14:01.480 --> 14:03.240
and above all, righteous,

14:03.790 --> 14:05.790
conscientious, and chivalrous.

14:07.670 --> 14:08.200
Good.

14:09.790 --> 14:10.590
Right, Xueyu,

14:10.910 --> 14:11.840
your well-being

14:12.960 --> 14:14.760
should be held in your own hands.

14:15.320 --> 14:16.850
Don't let anyone force you.

14:17.910 --> 14:19.240
Alright, I understand.

14:19.670 --> 14:22.330
You must practice diligently
during this time.

14:22.440 --> 14:23.550
I'm looking forward

14:23.550 --> 14:25.030
to joining
the great hero Qiushui's adventure

14:25.030 --> 14:27.160
in the martial world six months later.

14:29.670 --> 14:30.930
I should get going now.

14:31.330 --> 14:32.670
Take good care of yourself

14:32.670 --> 14:35.330
and don't upset Father and Mother,
understand?

14:46.440 --> 14:47.480
Xiao Qiushui!

14:48.480 --> 14:49.010
Come out!

14:55.390 --> 14:56.250
Yiren, Kaiyan.

14:56.960 --> 14:58.890
Xueyu told me you had already left!

14:59.000 --> 14:59.670
What?

14:59.670 --> 15:01.130
Can't wait for us to leave?

15:01.320 --> 15:02.440
We're departing for Guangling,

15:02.440 --> 15:03.630
and you don't even see us off?

15:03.630 --> 15:05.160
Why so eager to get rid of us?

15:07.030 --> 15:08.630
I'm feeling dizzy. So dizzy.

15:10.150 --> 15:12.240
Yiren has something to tell you.

15:19.030 --> 15:19.890
After we leave,

15:20.510 --> 15:22.970
you must take good care
of Father and Mother,

15:23.000 --> 15:25.130
listen to them, and not irritate them.

15:25.280 --> 15:26.010
Understand?

15:30.390 --> 15:31.080
That hurts?

15:32.080 --> 15:32.940
No, it doesn't.

15:33.630 --> 15:34.600
Are you still mad

15:36.120 --> 15:37.520
at Yiren because of this?

15:38.390 --> 15:39.080
Not at all.

15:40.030 --> 15:41.630
Yiren, Kaiyan, don't worry.

15:41.670 --> 15:44.600
I'll definitely take good care
of Father and Mother.

15:51.120 --> 15:54.050
After we leave,
focus on your martial arts practice.

15:54.360 --> 15:55.960
When we return in six months,

15:56.600 --> 15:58.600
let's have another match properly.

16:01.150 --> 16:02.630
Stay home and behave yourself.

16:02.630 --> 16:04.440
Don't cause trouble for Father and Mother.

16:04.440 --> 16:04.970
Let's go.

16:06.200 --> 16:06.870
Take care!

16:07.630 --> 16:09.510
Yiren, Kaiyang, stay safe!

16:10.270 --> 16:11.000
Don't worry!

16:19.720 --> 16:20.850
Greetings, Master.

16:25.030 --> 16:26.360
How's the preparation?

16:27.390 --> 16:29.150
I have summoned all our men to Jindu

16:29.150 --> 16:30.410
from around Chuanjin,

16:30.600 --> 16:32.400
waiting for your order, Master.

16:32.510 --> 16:34.240
We'll use the excuse
of avenging Fu Tianyi,

16:34.240 --> 16:36.480
so no one will meddle
in our actions against the Xiao family.

16:36.480 --> 16:37.940
What about the Sword King?

16:38.870 --> 16:40.480
Since Purple Phoenix's ambush against you,

16:40.480 --> 16:41.880
he hasn't made any moves.

16:44.270 --> 16:45.130
Stay vigilant.

16:46.030 --> 16:48.960
Don't let him get his hands
on the Hero Command Token.

16:49.360 --> 16:50.090
Yes, Master.

16:51.030 --> 16:53.760
Old Madam Wu is already
hiding in the Sword Manor.

16:55.310 --> 16:56.970
They've noticed our actions?

16:57.670 --> 16:58.730
It doesn't matter.

16:59.030 --> 17:01.840
You just focus on driving the Xiao family
into a corner.

17:01.840 --> 17:03.360
I have my own way to enter the Sword Manor

17:03.360 --> 17:04.560
and find Old Madam Wu.

17:05.310 --> 17:06.640
Should I inform the others
of your presence

17:06.640 --> 17:08.270
at the Xiao Residence, Master?

17:08.270 --> 17:09.510
They don't know your real appearance.

17:09.510 --> 17:11.310
I'm afraid they might disturb you.

17:11.310 --> 17:13.170
They don't have that capability.

17:13.400 --> 17:14.200
Remember,

17:16.000 --> 17:18.440
show no mercy to the Xiao family.

17:22.109 --> 17:23.970
I want their whole clan wiped out.

17:25.720 --> 17:26.270
Yes.

17:30.330 --> 17:32.640
[Jindu]

17:35.510 --> 17:36.440
One bowl of noodles, please.

17:36.440 --> 17:37.370
Coming right up!

17:39.750 --> 17:40.880
There you are, miss.

17:41.920 --> 17:43.050
Have some tea first.

17:45.110 --> 17:46.110
Nice! Bravo!

17:48.000 --> 17:50.350
May I ask where the Huanhua Sect is?

17:50.680 --> 17:51.640
Oh, its location?

17:51.640 --> 17:53.680
Just follow this road south,
and you'll reach

17:53.680 --> 17:54.680
the Xiao Residence of Huanhua Sect.

17:54.680 --> 17:56.030
-Take a look!
-Nice!

17:56.550 --> 17:57.160
Thank you.

17:57.750 --> 18:00.350
Just a minute.
Your noodles will be ready soon.

18:00.750 --> 18:02.550
Using the pretext of looking for Tang Rou,

18:02.550 --> 18:04.440
I should be able
to sneak into the Xiao Residence

18:04.440 --> 18:06.640
and forage for that Hero Command Token.

18:12.880 --> 18:14.140
What's this all about?

18:16.110 --> 18:18.040
What's going on in broad daylight?

18:21.400 --> 18:22.440
What a jinx!

18:24.400 --> 18:24.920
How ominous!

18:24.920 --> 18:25.920
Let me take a look.

18:25.960 --> 18:26.590
Let me see.

18:29.830 --> 18:31.230
I can't tell what this is.

18:31.550 --> 18:32.410
The Power Gang.

18:39.160 --> 18:39.640
This...

18:40.680 --> 18:41.400
A coffin?

18:42.160 --> 18:43.360
Let's go check it out.

18:47.890 --> 18:49.830
[Xiao Qiushui]

18:50.640 --> 18:51.920
Xiao Qiushui's sword?

18:53.070 --> 18:55.530
The Power Gang is targeting
the Xiao family.

19:05.250 --> 19:07.550
[The Power Gang's about to attack. Escort
Old Madam Wu out of the Xiao Residence.]

19:06.090 --> 19:07.250
The Power Gang's

19:07.650 --> 19:08.800
about to attack.

19:09.400 --> 19:11.130
The news still got out.

19:13.160 --> 19:14.640
Father! Mother!

19:15.720 --> 19:18.110
Qiushui, why are you in such a panic?

19:18.400 --> 19:19.440
Father, Mother,

19:19.640 --> 19:20.200
I...

19:29.920 --> 19:30.880
Father, Mother,

19:31.410 --> 19:33.610
the weather has been wonderful lately,

19:33.790 --> 19:35.590
perfect for hiking and outings.

19:35.880 --> 19:36.790
Why don't we

19:37.070 --> 19:38.400
go out for a trip sometime soon?

19:38.400 --> 19:39.400
What do you think?

19:41.310 --> 19:42.550
Xiao Qiushui,

19:42.960 --> 19:44.640
what are you up to again?

19:45.680 --> 19:46.480
Qiushui.

19:47.590 --> 19:48.520
What's going on?

19:49.920 --> 19:50.440
Father.

19:51.640 --> 19:52.480
Xiao Qiushui!

19:52.640 --> 19:53.310
Fang!

19:53.590 --> 19:54.830
Fang, Fang!

19:55.200 --> 19:56.440
Fang! Fang!

19:58.070 --> 19:58.870
Xiao Qiushui,

19:59.160 --> 20:01.180
let Tang Rou
leave the Xiao Residence immediately.

20:01.180 --> 20:03.960
Don't drag my brother
into the trouble you caused.

20:03.960 --> 20:06.960
The Power Gang
has placed their blood coffin in Jindu.

20:09.200 --> 20:11.410
The Power Gang has brought out
the blood coffin?

20:11.410 --> 20:12.870
They're seeking revenge!

20:13.750 --> 20:14.480
Sect Leader!

20:15.240 --> 20:15.970
Sect Leader!

20:17.750 --> 20:18.480
Sect Leader,

20:19.110 --> 20:21.910
a blood coffin
of the Power Gang was found in Jindu.

20:21.920 --> 20:22.920
Inside the coffin

20:23.240 --> 20:25.240
lay the Third Young Master's sword.

20:33.720 --> 20:34.480
You may go.

20:34.830 --> 20:35.270
Yes.

20:38.830 --> 20:40.560
Wasn't that sword disposed of?

20:41.830 --> 20:42.400
Qiushui,

20:42.920 --> 20:44.980
when did you mess with the Power Gang?

20:46.070 --> 20:47.240
What now?

20:47.650 --> 20:49.060
I did burn it.

20:49.680 --> 20:50.350
Qiushui,

20:50.880 --> 20:53.550
tell me everything that happened.

21:08.480 --> 21:11.110
Qiushui killed
the Iron-Fisted Demon Fu Tianyi?

21:11.110 --> 21:14.070
Three years ago,
the Tiger-Subduing Blade in Huizhou

21:14.070 --> 21:16.800
took over a pawnshop
belonging to the Power Gang,

21:16.830 --> 21:20.290
causing his entire family of 12
to be slaughtered in one night.

21:20.310 --> 21:23.310
The Tongding Sect in Heluo had a dispute
with the Power Gang

21:23.310 --> 21:24.570
over a ferry crossing.

21:25.310 --> 21:26.510
The entire sect was massacred,

21:26.510 --> 21:28.720
bound, and thrown into the water to drown.

21:28.720 --> 21:30.000
This is what you get

21:30.480 --> 21:32.210
once you offend the Power Gang.

21:32.750 --> 21:34.350
In no case will they let it go.

21:43.960 --> 21:46.160
If what the Power Gang wants is revenge,

21:46.550 --> 21:47.950
they can come at me alone.

21:48.480 --> 21:49.940
Now, the priority is for us

21:50.640 --> 21:52.640
to leave Huanhua Sect immediately.

21:52.640 --> 21:53.750
Father, Mother,

21:54.510 --> 21:56.040
I'll make sure you're safe.

21:56.160 --> 21:57.480
What's your plan?

21:58.750 --> 21:59.350
Qiushui,

22:00.880 --> 22:01.790
you're saying

22:01.960 --> 22:05.960
that the Gold and Silver Bank
colludes with the Northern Wastelanders.

22:06.000 --> 22:06.930
Can you prove it?

22:11.440 --> 22:12.900
Father, please read this.

22:15.000 --> 22:16.200
I've found evidence.

22:16.750 --> 22:17.550
I was planning

22:17.790 --> 22:20.310
to tell you when this matter was over.

22:22.510 --> 22:23.910
It seems like the whisper

22:24.270 --> 22:27.110
about the Power Gang's collusion
with the Northern Wastelanders

22:27.110 --> 22:28.310
is not a rumor at all.

22:28.830 --> 22:29.480
Mr. Xiao,

22:30.030 --> 22:32.470
the Gold and Silver Bank
is Fu Tianyi's private property.

22:32.470 --> 22:33.470
This letter alone

22:33.790 --> 22:36.830
can't prove the Power Gang
is in collusion with intruders.

22:36.830 --> 22:38.070
But Fu Tianyi was.

22:38.880 --> 22:39.830
That's enough.

22:42.030 --> 22:46.480
Qiushui didn't make an enemy
in the martial world.

22:47.110 --> 22:50.400
He just killed a vicious man
who committed treason.

22:51.830 --> 22:54.230
Why should we fear anyone seeking revenge?

22:56.510 --> 23:01.070
Today, it has come to light
that Xiao Qiushui,
the Xiao family's third young master,

23:01.070 --> 23:02.200
executed a traitor.

23:02.640 --> 23:06.000
It is truly an honor for the Xiao family.

23:06.720 --> 23:08.240
The Xiao family will bear

23:09.110 --> 23:11.970
the consequences of his acts.

23:13.200 --> 23:15.860
None of you
have anything to do with this matter.

23:16.440 --> 23:18.440
Please leave this place right away.

23:19.000 --> 23:22.350
After the Xiao family
weathers through this crisis,

23:23.000 --> 23:25.920
we will invite you for drinks again.

23:26.550 --> 23:27.160
Goodbye.

23:28.480 --> 23:29.070
Mr. Xiao,

23:29.640 --> 23:31.370
you're determined to be a hero,

23:31.550 --> 23:33.790
yet you're telling us to flee
like cowards.

23:33.790 --> 23:35.650
Are you looking down on us or what?

23:35.880 --> 23:37.140
Senior, your concerns

23:37.200 --> 23:38.130
are my concerns.

23:38.790 --> 23:40.120
That's right, Mr. Xiao.

23:40.550 --> 23:42.480
After all our years of friendship,

23:42.790 --> 23:45.450
this time,
I swear to stand with the Xiao family.

23:45.820 --> 23:47.830
I've often come here for tea
over these years.

23:47.830 --> 23:49.510
How can I not
align myself with the Xiao family?

23:49.510 --> 23:51.710
I... will certainly stick with Father.

23:52.720 --> 23:53.350
Mr. Xiao,

23:54.440 --> 23:56.300
we're Qiushui's sworn brothers.

23:56.400 --> 23:57.600
We will not back down.

23:58.010 --> 23:59.160
You have a death wish or what?

23:59.160 --> 24:01.220
We've sworn to live and die together.

24:01.550 --> 24:02.950
You can't change my mind.

24:06.240 --> 24:07.600
Since my brother has chosen to stay,

24:07.600 --> 24:09.000
I'll be here with him as well.

24:09.000 --> 24:10.030
For the sake of the martial world,

24:10.030 --> 24:11.490
it's the right thing to do.

24:17.270 --> 24:18.270
Sect Leader Xiao,

24:18.550 --> 24:19.810
Qiushui saved my life.

24:20.270 --> 24:21.930
I'll be with him in adversity.

24:23.750 --> 24:25.210
Young gentlemen and lady,

24:27.240 --> 24:28.440
how righteous of you.

24:28.920 --> 24:31.240
I truly appreciate your help.

24:31.880 --> 24:36.310
Today, with so many heroes here,

24:36.310 --> 24:38.440
however formidable the Power Gang is,

24:38.590 --> 24:41.110
we'll stand a chance of fighting them off.

24:42.000 --> 24:43.550
Thank you so much.

24:49.720 --> 24:50.450
Sect Leader!

24:51.480 --> 24:52.210
Sect Leader!

24:56.910 --> 24:58.590
Out there comes...

25:10.020 --> 25:14.230
[Xiao Residence]

25:22.680 --> 25:25.140
The fog is poisonous.
Everyone, be careful!

25:26.570 --> 25:28.790
So the plot is following
the original story.

25:28.790 --> 25:30.480
But I did save Tang Rou's life.

25:31.100 --> 25:32.340
Does it mean

25:32.790 --> 25:34.510
it's possible for me
to rescue the Xiao family

25:34.510 --> 25:36.840
and help everyone survive this disaster?

25:50.650 --> 25:51.650
Form a formation!

26:12.240 --> 26:13.440
I've heard much about

26:13.880 --> 26:16.010
the Power Gang's omnipotent members.

26:16.160 --> 26:17.690
Each is a top-class master.

26:18.680 --> 26:20.740
Now that you've come to Huanhua Sect,

26:21.110 --> 26:22.570
why not show up and meet me?

26:23.200 --> 26:25.680
I'd like to a be a good host to you all!

26:35.880 --> 26:37.540
Even your own life is at stake.

26:37.750 --> 26:39.150
How can you be a good host?

26:40.310 --> 26:42.960
Sect Leader Xiao,
you're overestimating yourself.

26:40.900 --> 26:43.040
[Kong Yangqin]
[Sword Demon, Power Gang]

26:47.270 --> 26:49.830
You must be the Sword Demon,

26:50.200 --> 26:51.060
Kong Yangqin.

26:51.920 --> 26:53.200
Today, I came here

26:53.510 --> 26:55.840
to ask you for one thing,
Sect Leader Xiao.

26:56.480 --> 26:57.350
One thing?

26:58.030 --> 26:59.080
Aren't you here

26:59.100 --> 27:02.030
for the Northern Wastelanders'
evil aide Fu Tianyi?

27:02.590 --> 27:05.270
His life was worth nothing.

27:06.510 --> 27:09.570
Sect Leader Xiao,
hand over the Hero Command Token now.

27:16.350 --> 27:18.350
I'm afraid you'll be disappointed.

27:18.680 --> 27:21.610
The Xiao family doesn't have
the Hero Command Token.

27:22.750 --> 27:23.430
Fine.

27:25.030 --> 27:27.560
I guess you've braced yourself
for the deaths

27:28.270 --> 27:29.590
of your entire family.

27:35.920 --> 27:38.030
Since we're part of the martial world,

27:38.030 --> 27:39.830
we'll face death without dread.

27:45.400 --> 27:46.030
Good.

27:46.830 --> 27:49.880
Life is short. People have to die one day.

27:51.160 --> 27:54.500
This tune shall be your funeral dirge!

28:15.640 --> 28:16.830
I remember the attackers
of the Xiao family

28:16.830 --> 28:18.830
include Kong Yangqin, Sha Qiandeng

28:19.310 --> 28:20.000
and the Poison Demon

28:20.000 --> 28:21.350
who looks like a child,

28:21.350 --> 28:22.280
named Hua Gufen.

28:22.640 --> 28:24.240
He's a real expert at poison.

28:24.240 --> 28:25.920
I must locate him first.

28:45.720 --> 28:46.510
[Sha Qiandeng]
[Wolf Demon of Flying Daggers, Power Gang]

28:53.240 --> 28:53.920
Qiushui!

28:54.510 --> 28:56.640
Let go. He's not a kid anymore.

28:59.790 --> 29:01.240
Mother, don't worry.

29:01.880 --> 29:03.140
Look out for yourself.

29:15.640 --> 29:17.900
Qiushui, be wary of the puppet warriors!

29:18.030 --> 29:19.000
They only know to kill.

29:19.000 --> 29:20.400
Weapons can't hurt them!

31:09.220 --> 31:10.250
[Hua Gufen]
[Poison Demon, Power Gang]

31:26.110 --> 31:28.510
Xiao's disciples, form a sword formation!

31:51.220 --> 31:52.550
Xilou, are you alright?

31:53.680 --> 31:54.270
I'm fine.

31:59.830 --> 32:01.160
Qiushui, how are you?

32:01.940 --> 32:03.330
I'm fine. Are you okay?

32:03.550 --> 32:04.160
How are you?

32:04.160 --> 32:04.690
I'm fine.

32:05.440 --> 32:10.880
Kill!

32:10.880 --> 32:15.310
Charge!

32:15.510 --> 32:20.550
Charge!

32:20.550 --> 32:23.480
Charge!

32:36.880 --> 32:37.470
Xilou!

32:37.500 --> 32:37.960
Father.

32:38.700 --> 32:39.600
-Are you okay?
-Xilou.

32:39.600 --> 32:40.330
I'm all good.

32:44.680 --> 32:46.010
Back to the Sword Manor.

32:46.070 --> 32:46.550
Got it.

32:46.910 --> 32:47.770
-Let's go.
-Go.

32:49.610 --> 32:50.130
Move.

33:08.670 --> 33:09.470
Go after them!

33:14.250 --> 33:15.350
Master, Master!

33:15.550 --> 33:16.160
Madam!

33:16.440 --> 33:17.370
How is everyone?

33:17.680 --> 33:19.960
Go, attend to the wounded.

33:20.680 --> 33:22.880
Yes. Get a move on! Come with me.

33:23.400 --> 33:25.200
-Slowly.
-Come this way.

33:28.310 --> 33:28.920
Careful.

33:30.440 --> 33:33.070
Mr. Xiao, how long can we hold out here?

33:38.400 --> 33:39.660
Don't worry, Mr. Kang.

33:40.110 --> 33:42.640
When the Sword Manor
was under construction,

33:43.510 --> 33:44.550
the possibility of

33:44.550 --> 33:47.310
Huanhua Sect resisting
the Northern Wastelanders

33:47.310 --> 33:49.790
right here was taken into consideration.

33:50.830 --> 33:53.480
It's as solid as a fortress

33:53.880 --> 33:55.410
with abundant provisions.

33:55.550 --> 33:57.270
We can stay here for months

33:57.750 --> 33:59.400
or even longer.

34:00.030 --> 34:00.830
Rest assured.

34:12.030 --> 34:14.290
They've all retreated to the Sword Manor

34:14.480 --> 34:15.610
as Master expected.

34:22.590 --> 34:24.440
Qiushui has really grown up.

34:24.710 --> 34:26.639
He can handle things on his own now.

34:27.630 --> 34:28.760
Don't be cocky, Son.

34:29.030 --> 34:31.690
You must refrain from
acting recklessly again.

34:33.920 --> 34:34.850
Father, Mother,

34:35.670 --> 34:36.480
I understand.

34:37.340 --> 34:39.340
Now, I need your confirmation

34:39.400 --> 34:41.070
on a very important issue.

34:42.030 --> 34:44.800
Is Old Madam Wu in the Xiao Residence?

34:49.440 --> 34:50.440
You're saying...

34:51.190 --> 34:53.110
Many guards were placed
around a bed chamber.

34:53.110 --> 34:55.440
Kong Yangqin specifically
asked for the Hero Command Token.

34:55.440 --> 34:56.880
I-Isn't it obvious?

34:59.190 --> 35:00.120
Father, Mother,

35:00.230 --> 35:01.880
is Old Madam Wu safe now?

35:02.810 --> 35:05.770
That day, when you made a kerfuffle

35:05.790 --> 35:07.850
with that thing called searchlight,

35:07.980 --> 35:10.440
your father and I started to feel worried.

35:10.800 --> 35:13.480
So, we sent Old Madam Wu
to the Sword Manor early.

35:13.840 --> 35:15.840
She's now staying at Zhenmei Pavilion.

35:15.840 --> 35:16.920
What happened today proves

35:16.920 --> 35:18.720
we made a right decision in time.

35:19.230 --> 35:20.160
Father, Mother,

35:20.480 --> 35:22.810
is there a secret passage in our residence

35:22.820 --> 35:23.480
that allows us

35:23.480 --> 35:25.410
to leave Huanhua Sect undetected?

35:26.990 --> 35:29.190
The Sword Manor is as good as a fortress.

35:29.360 --> 35:31.360
What do we need a secret passage for?

35:31.360 --> 35:31.960
Besides,

35:32.150 --> 35:34.550
the enemies outside have besieged us.

35:34.960 --> 35:37.190
There's no way for us to sneak out.

35:37.590 --> 35:39.440
But don't you worry.

35:39.920 --> 35:41.400
This place is impenetrable.

35:41.400 --> 35:42.400
Staying here

35:42.630 --> 35:44.880
can keep us from danger for some time.

35:47.110 --> 35:48.590
However, we've planned

35:49.000 --> 35:51.400
to escort Old Madam Wu to meet

35:51.630 --> 35:53.670
General Wu's soldiers in two days.

35:54.760 --> 35:57.840
I'm afraid that won't happen as scheduled.

36:01.480 --> 36:02.410
Father, Mother,

36:02.670 --> 36:03.960
though I don't know the next moves

36:03.960 --> 36:04.960
of the Power Gang,

36:05.230 --> 36:06.490
I always have a feeling

36:06.550 --> 36:08.610
that they've prepared a trick or two.

36:08.630 --> 36:10.590
If they have a spy in the Sword Manor,

36:10.590 --> 36:13.030
then this place
is not as safe as we think.

36:18.590 --> 36:20.630
How thoughtful of you.

36:21.510 --> 36:22.440
But don't worry.

36:23.670 --> 36:25.530
We've made proper arrangements.

36:25.920 --> 36:28.590
However, everyone is exhausted now.

36:28.960 --> 36:30.890
Once the situation is stabilized,

36:31.070 --> 36:33.760
your mother and I will conduct
a thorough check.

36:36.440 --> 36:38.070
Alright. Many of us got wounded

36:38.070 --> 36:39.130
in today's battle.

36:39.630 --> 36:41.070
Before discussing the next steps,

36:41.070 --> 36:42.530
why not have a feast first?

36:43.360 --> 36:44.560
Your mother is right.

36:59.150 --> 37:00.550
Let's raise our glasses.

37:01.710 --> 37:04.710
I extend my heartfelt gratitude
to you all.

37:04.760 --> 37:05.150
Cheers.

37:05.150 --> 37:05.880
Thanks, Mr. Xiao.

37:05.880 --> 37:06.920
Bottoms up!

37:12.800 --> 37:13.480
Mr. Xiao,

37:14.400 --> 37:17.000
the Power Gang
has surrounded the Sword Manor.

37:17.030 --> 37:19.800
Yet here we are,
enjoying food and drinks inside.

37:20.360 --> 37:20.890
I mean...

37:23.480 --> 37:24.670
During the reign of Emperor Taizong...

37:24.670 --> 37:25.190
Enjoy.

37:25.320 --> 37:27.150
Our army once retreated in defeat.

37:27.150 --> 37:29.320
Everybody was in panic,

37:30.070 --> 37:33.630
except General Li Ji,
who ate as usual and commanded the troops

37:33.630 --> 37:34.560
with composure.

37:35.190 --> 37:39.030
That was
how General Taizong stayed unscathed.

37:39.800 --> 37:42.440
Now, let's learn from
the wise men of the past

37:43.230 --> 37:46.440
and maintain our heroic spirit.

37:48.960 --> 37:51.280
It's a pity
that our wounded fellows in recovery

37:51.280 --> 37:52.940
are missing out on this feast.

37:54.800 --> 37:57.150
When Qiushui confronted
the Power Gang today,

37:57.150 --> 37:58.350
he didn't fear at all.

37:58.710 --> 38:00.240
How brave and clever of him.

38:00.670 --> 38:03.190
No wonder Mr. Kang
strongly recommended him.

38:03.190 --> 38:05.250
He's truly an impressive young hero.

38:06.150 --> 38:07.960
Stop paying compliments to him, guys.

38:07.960 --> 38:10.550
Or Qiushui will become too proud.

38:11.480 --> 38:13.400
You punish him every now and then.

38:13.710 --> 38:16.310
Maybe it's a way to train him
to be a real master.

38:16.360 --> 38:17.360
Come on, Qiushui.

38:17.920 --> 38:18.720
A toast to you.

38:19.230 --> 38:20.760
Uncle Zhu, this is too much.

38:20.960 --> 38:22.550
Just have a drink. Go ahead.

38:26.320 --> 38:28.400
Uncle Zhu, it should be me

38:28.960 --> 38:30.400
who makes a toast to everyone

38:30.400 --> 38:32.460
for your dedication to Huanhua Sect.

38:35.150 --> 38:38.320
I've read many stories about heroes.

38:39.630 --> 38:40.760
I found what they did

38:42.400 --> 38:43.480
truly admirable.

38:44.920 --> 38:45.880
But I thought...

38:46.230 --> 38:47.880
stories were just stories

38:48.510 --> 38:50.840
and that they wouldn't happen in reality.

38:50.880 --> 38:53.610
Nonetheless, today,
seeing each of you fighting

38:53.920 --> 38:56.250
for Huanhua Sect in regardless of danger,

38:56.960 --> 38:59.760
I found you more admirable
than those characters.

39:01.670 --> 39:04.630
Here, I propose a toast to you all.

39:07.320 --> 39:08.120
Come on, guys.

39:08.360 --> 39:09.960
-Come on.
-I like what you said.

39:09.960 --> 39:10.620
Bottoms up.

39:10.960 --> 39:11.960
-Come on.
-Drink it up.

39:11.960 --> 39:12.420
Cheers.

39:12.920 --> 39:13.380
Cheers!

39:14.320 --> 39:14.800
Cheers.

39:18.400 --> 39:19.260
Such good wine.

39:20.280 --> 39:20.810
Alright.

39:20.840 --> 39:21.640
Fill my glass.

39:21.670 --> 39:22.670
Do it yourself.

39:24.030 --> 39:24.830
Drink with me.

39:25.280 --> 39:25.760
Come on.

39:26.320 --> 39:27.000
Nice wine.

39:27.000 --> 39:28.400
Why didn't you finish it?

39:28.510 --> 39:28.880
I...

39:28.880 --> 39:30.110
-You must be punished!
-I'll fill your glass.

39:30.110 --> 39:30.480
Such good wine.

39:30.480 --> 39:32.080
-Punishment!
-Punishment!

39:33.070 --> 39:33.710
-Come on.
-You two...

39:33.710 --> 39:34.480
Fill up the glasses.

39:34.480 --> 39:35.680
Thank you, everyone.

39:36.550 --> 39:37.070
Cheers.

39:37.360 --> 39:37.800
Let's get drunk!

39:37.800 --> 39:38.860
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

39:52.800 --> 39:53.660
Pour some more.

39:54.510 --> 39:55.280
No need to rush.

39:55.280 --> 39:57.070
-Come on.
-You're spilling it!

39:57.800 --> 39:59.660
Are you drunk before drinking it?

40:00.230 --> 40:00.960
Bottoms up!

40:01.320 --> 40:01.780
Cheers.

40:04.840 --> 40:06.030
Dig in, guys.

40:06.030 --> 40:07.290
Let me fill your glass.

40:13.530 --> 40:15.050
Miss Tang, a toast to you.

40:21.280 --> 40:22.680
What are you doing, Fang?

40:25.000 --> 40:26.190
Eat now, you.

40:26.190 --> 40:27.000
Fine.

40:28.020 --> 40:30.230
Fang, I thought

40:30.440 --> 40:32.710
cutthroat competition
was all that had left in Tang Sect.

40:32.710 --> 40:35.320
But when you said
you'd stick with the Xiao family

40:35.320 --> 40:37.230
to save Jinzhong's martial community,

40:37.230 --> 40:38.290
I finally realized

40:39.110 --> 40:40.440
that my sister was born with

40:40.440 --> 40:42.570
a sense of justice and righteousness.

40:42.760 --> 40:44.280
Fang, a toast to you.

40:44.720 --> 40:45.280
Right.

40:45.440 --> 40:46.440
Let's make a toast to Miss Tang.

40:46.440 --> 40:47.840
A toast to you, Miss Tang.

40:51.630 --> 40:53.320
Alright. Go have drinks.

40:53.320 --> 40:53.920
Off you go.

40:56.000 --> 40:56.550
Cheers.

40:57.150 --> 40:58.320
Fish is good for the brain.

40:58.320 --> 40:58.780
Indeed.

40:59.190 --> 41:02.250
Fish improves intelligence.
You should eat more of it.

41:03.920 --> 41:04.840
Come on!

41:06.760 --> 41:09.620
I chose to stay
only to look for the Voidheart Codex.

41:09.760 --> 41:11.090
How foolish of you boys.

41:16.480 --> 41:18.360
-Cheers, guys.
-Cheers.

41:18.480 --> 41:19.480
Drink it up.

41:20.150 --> 41:20.800
Everyone!

41:21.110 --> 41:23.000
Third Young Master.

41:23.510 --> 41:24.710
You all did a good job.

41:25.110 --> 41:26.480
Here's a toast to all of you.

41:26.480 --> 41:28.670
To Third Young Master!

41:29.400 --> 41:29.920
Cheers!

41:34.280 --> 41:35.590
Take your seats.

41:35.710 --> 41:36.630
-Okay.
-Sit down.

41:36.630 --> 41:37.510
Come on, guys.

41:37.630 --> 41:38.480
Drink with me.

41:38.840 --> 41:39.440
Guys, come on.

41:39.440 --> 41:40.840
-Hey, guys.
-Bottoms up!

41:41.510 --> 41:43.070
Fill your glasses, guys!

41:43.070 --> 41:44.680
-Bottoms up!
-Pour some more!

41:44.680 --> 41:45.480
How pleasant!

42:11.150 --> 42:12.280
Sir, please

42:12.360 --> 42:13.800
stop ringing the bell!

42:18.000 --> 42:20.530
It seems like the Misery Pill
you ate years ago

42:21.350 --> 42:22.280
still works.

42:30.550 --> 42:31.510
Thank you, sir.

42:32.360 --> 42:33.420
Rest assured, sir.

42:33.510 --> 42:36.960
I will never betray the chief.

42:37.510 --> 42:39.640
You've been in Huanhua Sect for years.

42:39.920 --> 42:42.590
It is high time you carried out tasks.

42:42.760 --> 42:43.360
Yes.

42:43.920 --> 42:47.360
I pledge my allegiance to the Power Gang.

42:48.110 --> 42:49.640
I'll never betray you, sir.

42:53.920 --> 42:54.920
I knew I was right.

42:54.960 --> 42:55.630
Yeah.

42:56.000 --> 42:57.060
Bad news! Bad news!

42:57.400 --> 42:58.730
The woodshed is on fire!

42:59.030 --> 43:00.360
The woodshed is on fire?

43:00.510 --> 43:01.670
Let's go!

43:01.670 --> 43:02.030
Hurry! Go!

43:02.030 --> 43:02.560
Be quick!

43:02.760 --> 43:03.290
Let's go.

